hadiths[34]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1633","Yahya related to me from Malik that Muadh ibn Jabal said"
"1634","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab from Urwa ibn az- Zubayr that A'isha"
"1635","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab from Ali ibn Husayn ibn Ali ibn Abi Talib that the Messenger of Allah"
"1636","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that A'isha"
"1637","Yahya related to me from Malik from his paternal uncle"
"1638","Yahya related to me from Malik that Yahya ibn Said said"
"1639","Yahya related to me from Malik that Yahya ibn Said said that he heard Said ibn al-Musayyab say"
"1640","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that the Messenger of Allah"
"1641","Yahya related to me from Malik from Salama ibn Safwan ibn Salama az-Zuraqi that Zayd ibn Talha ibn Rukana"
"1642","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab from Salim ibn Abdullah from Abdullah ibn Umar that the Messenger of Allah"
"1643","Malik related to me from Ibn Shihab from Humayd ibn Abd ar-Rahman ibn Awf that a man came to the Messenger of Allah"
"1644","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab from Said ibn al- Musayyab from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"1645","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab from Ata ibn Yazid al-Laythi from Abu Ayyub al-Ansari that the Messenger of Allah"
"1646","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab from Anas ibn Malik that the Messenger of Allah"
"1647","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abu'z-Zinad from al-Araj from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"1648","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ata ibn Abi Muslim that Abdullah al-Khurasani said"
"1649","Yahya related to me from Malik from Suhayl ibn Abi Salih from his father from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"1650","Yahya related to me from Malik from Muslim ibn Abi Maryam from Abu Salih as-Samman that Abu Hurayra said"
"1758","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abdullah ibn Dinar that Abdullah ibn Umar said that the Messenger of Allah"
"1759","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ishaq ibn Abdullah ibn Abi Talha from Abu Murra"
"1760","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ishaq ibn Abdullah ibn Abi Talha that Anas ibn Malik heard Umar ibn al-Khattab return the greeting of a man who greeted him. Then Umar asked the man"
"1761","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ishaq ibn Abdullah ibn Abi Talha that at-Tufayl ibn Ubayy ibn Kab told him that he visited Abdullah ibn Umar one morning and went out with him to the market"
"1764","Malik related to me from a reliable source of his from Bukayr ibn Abdullah ibn al-Ashajj from Basr ibn Said from Abu Said al-Khudri that Abu Musa al-Ashari said"
"1765","Malik related to me from Rabia ibn Abi Abd ar-Rahman from another of the ulama of that time that Abu Musa al-Ashari came and asked permission from Umar ibn al-Khattab to enter. He asked permission three times"
"1766","Malik related to me from Abdullah ibn Abi Bakr from his father that the Messenger of Allah"
"1767","Malik related to me from Nafi that when Abdullah ibn Umar sneezed and someone said to him"
"1768","Malik related to me from Ishaq ibn Abdullah ibn Abi Talha that Rafi ibn Ishaq"
"1769","Malik related to me from Abu'n-Nasr that Ubaydullah ibn Abdullah ibn Utba ibn Masud went to visit Abu Talha al-Ansari when he was ill. He said"
"1770","Malik related to me from Nafi from al-Qasim ibn Muhammad from A'isha"
"1771","Malik related to me from Abd ar-Rahman ibn Abdullah ibn Abd ar- Rahman ibn Abi Sasaca that Sulayman ibn Yasar said"
"1772","Malik related to me from Ibn Shihab from Abu Umama ibn Sahl ibn Hunayf from Abdullah ibn Abbas that Khalid ibn al-Walid ibn al-Mughira entered the house of Maimuna"
"1773","Malik related to me from Abdullah ibn Dinar from Abdullah ibn Umar that a man called the Messenger of Allah and said"
"1774","Malik related to me from Yazid ibn Khusayfa that as-Sa'ib ibn Yazid informed him that he heard Sufyan ibn Abi Zuhayr who was from the Azd Shanua tribe and among the companions of the Messenger of Allah"
"1775","Malik related to me from Nafi from Abdullah ibn Umar that the Messenger of Allah"